    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d586">

                <pb facs="0614" n="498" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg498"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.516/28.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister
                    Blanchard</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-01-04T12:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 4, 1915—noon</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>We understand threats are made against Williams and other employees of the Bank.
                    Keep in constant communication with the Bank and notify the Government that you
                    are instructed not to permit harm to be done to any American or other foreign
                    employee. Keep us constantly advised of situation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
